所以我陪着比我小四五岁的妹妹们看完了整整五季。

00:00:22.804 --> 00:00:40.000
But we all agreed that during that tough time, basically going through hunger and spending our days together, watching the show, the HD press narrowed down and we really became more than siblings, we became friends, and now this new episode of re-watching it with you all three years ago, I decided to leave the boring suits and engineering life to become an artist.
我们都一致认为，在那段艰难的时光里，我们基本是在挨饿，每天待在一起看这部剧，这拉近了我们的距离，我们真的不仅仅是兄妹，更成为了朋友。三年前，在重温这部剧时，我决定离开枯燥的西装和工程生活，去成为一名艺术家。

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:51.560
I've been acting for two years almost, listening to these podcast fields like another and very important academic resource, your insight, your tales, your opinions feel like a master class when being an artist.
我做演员快两年了，听这个播客就像在学习另一门非常重要的学术课程，你们的见解、故事和观点，对于一个艺术家来说就像大师课一样。

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:56.119
I admire you, love your respect to so much and I love human and art.
我钦佩你们，非常尊重你们，我也热爱人类和艺术。

00:00:56.119 --> 00:01:02.960
And in man's way that I promise you, I will be a passionate and dedicated actor and artist every single day of my life.
我向你们保证，我余生的每一天都会成为一名充满激情和奉献精神的演员和艺术家。

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:07.200
Thank you again, you have no idea how much you have inspired my life and the artist that I am.
再次感谢你们，你们无法想象你们给了我多大的启发，成就了今天的我。

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:27.170
I'm alone, for be soon, in New York City, when I see you, please permit me to tell you everything, in New York City.
我很快会独自去纽约，如果见到你们，请允许我把一切都告诉你们，在纽约。

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:30.329
Wow Diego, thank you so much for that.
哇，迭戈，非常感谢你的来信。

00:01:30.329 --> 00:01:33.569
an incredible letter to start this episode.
这是一封开启本集节目的绝佳信件。

00:01:33.569 --> 00:01:38.030
Maybe one of these days, one of these episodes, I won't almost burst into tears.
也许有一天，在某期节目里，我不会差点热泪盈眶。

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:42.930
Alex springs these beautiful things on us right as we, this is all in real time.
亚历克总是在我们毫无准备的时候抛出这些美好的东西，这一切都是实时的。

00:01:42.930 --> 00:01:47.010
